  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Symposium - U.S.-Colombia Smart Grid Workshop, through MFM Lamey Group, LLC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This indefinite quantity contract funded the U.S.-Colombia Smart Grid Workshop, a two-day event held in Bogota, Colombia. The workshop took place in February 2014 and included public and private sector participants from the U.S. and Colombian electricity sectors. The workshop&apos;s objective was to assist U.S. companies in capturing a share of the anticipated integration of smart grid systems in Colombia&apos;s electricity grid while providing Colombian entities with an introduction to state-of-the art smart grid systems and applications.</narrative>
  </description>
